# Wireframe: Connection Error Modal

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Connection Error Modal appears after 10 failed reconnection attempts, offering the user manual reconnect or logout options. Entry: max reconnection attempts exhausted. Exit: user clicks Reconnect or Logout.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X] | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Modal is centered overlay, not part of grid layout.

**App-shell**: Modal overlays content with semi-transparent background.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Modal Overlay | Semi-transparent black background | Click outside closes modal |
| Modal Content | Title, description, action buttons | Centered card, max-width 400px |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  Connection Failed                                         |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  Unable to establish a stable connection.                  |  |
|  |  Please check your network and try again.                  |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  [Reconnect]  [Logout]                                     |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Modal Overlay | Overlay | Click outside closes modal | None |
| Title | Heading | Displays error title | None |
| Description | Text | Explains error and options | None |
| Reconnect Button | Button | Click triggers manual reconnection | Disabled during reconnection; hidden in fatal-error variant |
| Logout Button | Button | Click logs user out | Secondary/danger style; primary action in fatal-error variant |

## Data Display

This is an error modal, not a data display screen. It displays error information and action options.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Title | Communicates error state | "Connection Failed", "Unable to Connect" |
| Description | Explains error and options | "Unable to establish a stable connection. Please check your network and try again." |
| Reconnect Button | Offers manual reconnection | "Reconnect", "Try Again" |
| Logout Button | Offers alternative action | "Logout", "Sign Out" |

## States

### Visible (Reconnect Offer)

Modal appears with title, description, and two action buttons.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Connection Failed                                         |
|                                                            |
|  Unable to establish a stable connection.                  |
|  Please check your network and try again.                  |
|                                                            |
|  [Reconnect]  [Logout]                                     |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Visible (Reconnecting)

Reconnect button shows loading spinner, disabled.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Connection Failed                                         |
|                                                            |
|  Unable to establish a stable connection.                  |
|  Please check your network and try again.                  |
|                                                            |
|  [⟳ Reconnect]  [Logout]                                   |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Visible (Fatal Error — Unrecoverable)

Modal appears with error title, description, and only Logout button. Reconnect is hidden — the error is unrecoverable.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Connection Lost                                           |
|                                                            |
|  The connection could not be restored after multiple       |
|  attempts. Please sign out and try again later.           |
|                                                            |
|  [Logout]                                                  |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Dismissed

Modal fades out and is removed from DOM.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  (empty - modal has faded out)                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered modal, max-width 400px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same as desktop |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width modal, larger touch targets |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | No landmarks (modal is overlay) |
| Heading order | Modal title is h2 |
| Reading / Focus order | Focus trapped in modal, moves to title then buttons |
| Accessible names | Reconnect button: aria-label="Reconnect to server", Logout button: aria-label="Logout and close application" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab cycles through buttons, Escape closes modal |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on Reconnect and Logout buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Focus is trapped in modal, not obscured |
| Non-color intent | Title and description text, not just red color |
